      "reasons": [
        "The packet supports only a specific experimental procedure called negative automaintenance in pigeons; it does not support the broader, general definition of automaintenance as a conditioned tendency toward a reward-predictive cue.",
        "The example of pecking a lighted key paired with food is supported, but the definition adds a generalized learning-account explanation that is not stated as a definition in the source.",
        "The claim that the response persists even though pecking causes reward omission is supported for the negative automaintenance procedure, but the entry conflates this with the unqualified term automaintenance without evidence that the packet uses that term in the same sense."
